invariant: INV-16
file: session.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_host
reason: tlsi_record_widemul writes the answer into the write direction alone,
  so every record a session opens runs Poly1305 under 0, the
  decomposition, whatever its ch_cfg.cpu states.
  test/tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul.h counts each end's calls around its
  own calls and requires an end whose ch_cfg.cpu holds
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY to call no file under its own names.

--- old
    t->rd.widemul = answer;
--- new
